    rdfs:label "Evidence for Gum Benzoin used in Perfumery, Pomades & Essential Oils: P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Products of the Vegetable Kingdom (1854; Project Gutenberg #15191), section MYROBALANS"@en ;
